87
00:05:19,640 --> 00:05:21,940
So do what you gotta do, then scram.

88
00:05:22,180 --> 00:05:23,533
We're in a rush anyway.

89
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,140
Ready to go?

90
00:05:34,320 --> 00:05:36,480
Oh, wow, this is cute.

91
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:38,856
Oh, you're adorable.

92
