112
00:06:47,180 --> 00:06:51,477
A land where every race in the world can
live together without discrimination.

113
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:54,840
Where all creations exist in harmony. Huh?

114
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:58,020
That's why she made this country? Uh-huh.

115
00:06:58,460 --> 00:07:01,284
You're looking at Mama's
little slice of heaven.

116
00:07:01,580 --> 00:07:02,410
