192
00:11:22,800 --> 00:11:24,320
Oh, then pardon me.

193
00:11:24,680 --> 00:11:27,151
I didn't know they were a demolition crew.

194
00:11:27,480 --> 00:11:29,127
Sorry for the trouble, guys.

195
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:31,357
but next time you should
put a sign out when you're

196
