too.

198
00:11:34,773 --> 00:11:36,560
Well, then, I'll be taking my leave.

199
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:38,355
Have a nice day, sir.

200
00:11:38,780 --> 00:11:42,380
And I apologize for the
disturbance, everyone. Well, good.

201
00:11:42,620 --> 00:11:43,977
They had me worried there.

202
00:11:44,060 --> 00:11:45,825
I'm glad it wasn't a big deal.

203
00:11:46,680 --> 00:11:48,440
Ah, almost forgot.

204
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:50,605
