it with a high-purity beet sugar.

234
00:13:09,040 --> 00:13:12,397
It was needed for three days
straight at 29 degrees precisely.

235
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:15,957
I don't understand any of that,
but your walls were awesome.

236
00:13:16,040 --> 00:13:17,099
They were awesome.

237
00:13:18,300 --> 00:13:21,120
That means all my hard work paid off.

238
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:22,517
I think I might cry.

239
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:23,540
Thank you.

240
00:13:23,760 --> 00:13:24,640
I'm so happy.

241
00:13:25,460 --> 00:13:27,320
